	(text "J_BAT = feed elektronika via F1 0,5A slow. Jalur 100 A TIDAK lewat sini (lihat RSH1, sheet 03)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55 87 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0ee54ba2-4b40-4168-8f22-26537f443942")	)
	(text "Tap pra-fuse: net BAT+ = masukan pembagi GPIO34 (sheet 04_BATTERY_ADC, S4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85 79 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f99a9c5-91fb-4d00-88be-ba0e3dd61c57")	)
	(text "M1 LM2596HVS (TECHPUBLIC 60V/3A/150kHz; Shopee PSU-0133; 43x21x14mm) — modul buck komersial\npilihan user (rev 2026-09-03) menggantikan LM5164 diskrit. IN 45-54V vs abs.maks 60V = margin 11%\n(pengecualian aturan >=2x — DN-S1-12, lihat design-notes par.11 rev). OUT disetel 5,00V +-2% via\ntrimpot SAAT ASSEMBLY (verifikasi DMM di TP_5V — prosedur power-up bertahap par.51).\nTanpa UVLO presisi: board aktif mulai VIN ~4,5V (DN-S1-15 — telemetri tetap hidup saat undervoltage).\nLoop switching 150kHz DI DALAM modul (EMI terlokalisasi). Mounting: standoff M3x8 + kawat 18AWG\n4x per label silkscreen IN+/IN-/OUT+/OUT-. Posisi pad & lubang = OPEN-006R (verifikasi unit fisik)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122 74 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cc2c401c-edaa-4a94-8b11-f528c24fb16b")	)
	(text "D2 SMBJ58A: Vrwm 58V > 54V baterai (tanpa konduksi normal). Clamp teoritis 93,1V @6,45A\nmelebihi 60V abs.maks modul — pengecualian DN-S1-12: arus surge dibatasi F1 time-lag +\nimpedansi kabel baterai; C57 + cap input modul (100uF/100V) menyerap transien.\nC50 = decouple HF di batas board; C57 = damping resonansi kabel (TI par.7.3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78 108 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8468b63a-db35-4a30-8c0e-845375bd7b84")	)
	(text "PGND star = node BATTERY- (blok terminal shunt, sheet 03) — design-notes par.6.\nReturn arus elektronik M1 (~65mA) TIDAK melewati elemen shunt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95 130 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "73d63344-20fa-41e5-a51a-1b8275e3d7a3")	)
	(text "U11 AP2112K-3.3 (600 mA). C80 10 uF milik S2 — ditempatkan dekat ESP32 (sheet 02)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 128 148 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b3250861-eb44-413e-92f9-484d2aaa25b2")	)
	(text "+5V_RELAY -> rantai E-stop (S6, sheet 09_EMERGENCY)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215 138 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a44ad9ff-1842-41a0-bad6-c711b8f78c36")	)
	(text_box "01_POWER — rantai daya 54 V -> 5 V -> 3,3 V (S1r2: revisi user, modul LM2596HVS).\nJ_BAT.1 (BAT+) -> F1 0,5A slow 63V -> D1 US1M (reverse) -> PROTECTED_VBAT\n  -> D2 TVS SMBJ58A + C50 2,2uF/100V + C57 47uF/100V bulk -> M1 modul LM2596HVS\n     (TECHPUBLIC 60V/3A/150kHz; set 5,00V trimpot saat assembly, verifikasi TP_5V)\n  -> +5V (C52 22uF) -> U11 AP2112K-3.3 -> +3V3.  Branch +5V -> F2 + FB50 -> +5V_RELAY (S6).\nTap divider GPIO34 PRA-F1 (net BAT+). PGND star = BATTERY- (sheet 03).\nCatatan: modul tanpa UVLO presisi (aktif mulai ~4,5V); loop switching di dalam modul;\npad/lubang footprint = OPEN-006R (verifikasi unit fisik sebelum fab).\nEvaluasi lengkap (margin 60V, TVS, inrush, termal, setting): design-notes.md par.11 rev."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 180 45)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "3a51ed0e-0a7e-41b6-9d61-9e9cda82f3f1")
	)
